<title>USA: Global DirectMail knows no reason for drop.</title>
<headline>Global DirectMail knows no reason for drop.</headline>
<dateline>PORT WASHINGTON, N.Y. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp issued a statement saying it &quot;knows of no development that would account for recent market activity,&quot; in response to a request by the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Shares closed down 1-1/2 to 25 on the NYSE on Tuesday on volume of about 881,300 shares.</p>
<p>It said it expects to post earnings per share of $0.31 compared to $0.26 last year when it releases second quarter earnings on Thursday, July 31, 1997.</p>
